			"Message": "docs(Echo): Revise README overview and architecture sections\n\nRewrite the Overview and Architecture sections of the Echo task scheduler's README to be more approachable and less jargon-heavy. Replace the dense bullet list (\"engineered to\") with plain-language explanations of priorities, work-stealing, and structured shutdown, and clarify the two-layer architecture (generic Queue + Scheduler)\n\nUpdate the Lock-Free Performance paragraph to describe the queue hierarchy (local → steal → global) in concrete terms rather than abstract crate names. Use emoji and cleaner formatting to improve scannability without changing any technical content.",
